  "name": "Question 13",
  "problem": "Which set is equivalent to $A={k\\in Z:|4k-2|\\le 6}?$",
  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the integer numbers that satisfy the inequality $|4k-2|\\le 6.$ So, we first need to solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|4k-2|\\le 6 \\\\ -6\\le 4k-2\\le 6 \\\\ -4\\le 4k\\le 8 \\\\ -1\\le k\\le 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe integer solutions of the above inequality are $-1,0,1,2.$ \n\nTherefore, the given set can be written as \n\n$$\nA={0,\\pm 1,2}.\n$$",
